window.products.push({"id":1038225,"name":"KANBIT Small Digital Alarm Clock Battery Operated,Large Display Easy to Read Loud Alarm Clock with Time/Temperature/Humidity/Snooze/Backlight,12/24H D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QtNQ0nqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE HD LCD SCREEN DISPLAY -The 5.3\" digital battery clock comes with a very big bold numbers LCD clear display, it shows time, date of the week, temperature, humidity with comfort display. Everything you need is all in one on this screen for you easily to read with a distance. EASY TO OPERATE - This digital alarm clock is very simple to set the time, year, turn on/off the alarm, change between Celsius and Fahrenheit for the thermometer, and switch 12/24H format. Only four buttons are on the back for you to operate. We provide the clear step-by-step instruction. You can easily set up the small digital clock within a few minutes. It gives you all the information you need without having to sleep with your cellphone. If you have any problems with your setting, please contact us through Amazon. LOUD ALARM & 8 MINS SNOOZE - This battery alarm clock has gradually soft beep alarm to stronger alarm for 1 minutes to wake you up in the morning so easily. This battery clock has loud beep sound which is perfect for heavy sleepers too. Press touch snooze button, you can get extra a 8-minute sleep. Say goodbye to be late. Your schedule is on time every day. ACCURATE TEMPERATURE & HUMIDITY - Home environment is very important to very family no matter in which seasons. We use new technology to create air-in design to make sure the values are accurate all the time. High-quality humanized design improves your quality of life. This battery powered alarm clock is also designed to add humidity function for your to know about the indoor comfort condition and decide whether to use the dehumidifier or not. DIGITAL ALARM CLOCK WITH TEMPORARY BACKLIGHT - Light it up as you need during the night, simply touch the top button, the soft backlight will be on for 8 seconds. Please note that the light won't stay on the whole night. BATTERY OPERATED ALARM CLOCK - This alarm clock is powered by two AA battery ( NOT INCLUDED). You can bring it anywhere you like such as bedside, bathroom, living room, office and also take it with you when you are travelling. GREAT GIFTS CHOICES - This modern battery powered alarm clock is an ideal gift for everyone you love for any holidays: family member, friends, seniors, kids, girls, boys, teens. It is a perfect decor for bedroom, living room or office. It fits any style. OUR WARRANTY & SERVICE - We have a one-year warranty for all our KANBIT products. If you have any questions, Please email us through Amazon Centre, we will get back to you within 24 hours. We are trying our best to satisfy our valued customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QtNQ0nqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KANBIT","source_asin":"B09WRCV7W1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WRCV7W1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WRCV7W1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
