window.products.push({"id":1038259,"name":"ILamourYou Stainless Steel Knife Sharpener, 2-Stage Diamond Coated Wheel System, Safe and Fast, Suitable for Straight and Serrated Knives","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UERsVY7oL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"ILamourYou is a family owned and operated business and we care that your needs as our customer are meet. We stand by our products and their quality. With this Knife Sharpener you will never worry about dull blades, hard times preparing food, wasted time fighting with archaic sharpeners of the past. Please contact customer service for the first time if you have questions or comments, we will reply you ASAP. If the return is caused by the product quality or the mistake from us, we are fully responsibility for all. Material: Diamond, stainless steel. Color: Black Size: Length: 8.1 in, Width: 2.4 in, Height: 2.5 in. Weight: 8.4 OZ 2 Stages Sharpener Knife: STAGE 1 (Coarse) uses Tungsten grinder blades to re-shape your knife, restoring the dullest, damaged knives back into shape. Tungsten is one of the strongest metals in existence. STAGE 2 (Fine) is a pair of Ceramic rounded blades to give your blades a smooth edge and create a fine honed sharpness. Suitable for kitchen knife, chef knife, boning knife, fruit knife and other household tool knife. Instructions: 1.Insert the blade into the slot at a 90-degree angle to the sharpener. 2.Place blade in carbide cutting heads(black in color). 3.Pull the knife straight back towards you(2-3 times) while applying a light pressure. 4.Place blade in ceramic fine smoothing rods(white in color). 5.Pull the knife straight back towards you (5-6 times) while applying heavy pressure. 6.If blade is still dull repeat these step until blade is sharp. Caution: 1.Pull inwards from the outside when you sharpen your knife, never go back and forth. 2.Please hold the handle tightly when you are sharpening your knives. 3.Wipe the grinder head with a clean dry cloth after washing and store in dry area.What you will get:1XKnife sharpener1XCut resistant gloves1XGift box1XUse manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UERsVY7oL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ILamourYou","source_asin":"B07M89XJT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M89XJT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M89XJT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
