window.products.push({"id":1038284,"name":"Laborsaving Toilet Cannon Plunger,Pneumatic Bathroom Dredging Plunger,Air Pressure Drain Plumber,Air Blaster Gun Plunger Efficient with Detachable Ass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ey6TaU5RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We had already helped more than 12,000 families and pumbers to resolve the problems and become their good friends.We offer 5 Free Replaceable Heads in each pack of this item.It has a flexible Handle and Easy Operating One Drive Button, So you never have to Call any urgent plumber or to use harsh chemicals. The plastic handle is made of a new material named ABS Plastic, the surface of this is smooth and easy to Clean. And strong grip feels during using this. You can receive free accessories.You can perfectly well use after a single full breath, avoiding repeated inflation. With professional and accurate instrument panel, the pneumatic activity and operating force can be accurately manipulated.(It is recommended to inflate to the barometer pointer position 2-4).Air Drain Blaster Gun with real-time display of pressure, which can be adjusted according to different dredging requirements,avoiding splashing and damage. The blaster pump is connected with the gun main plunger body and the air pressure is greater than that of the ordinary non-inflator, which is more convenient to use. The drain blaster uses the power of high-pressure compressed air to blast away the clogs quickly and easily,Plunger head ensures an sealing for great pressure.The air pressure is large and can be reused without having to inflate multiple times in an anxious situation.Much faster and more effective than traditional plunger and snake. The plungers are produced by the original factory.ABS plastic handle and natural rubber seal head are environmentally and durable.It has interchangeable plunger heads:toilet head,washbasin head,Conversion head and Pump head,Feet Pad. The plunger has a white ring hanging on the wall, which can be hung on the ring after use to prevent the plunger from lying on the wet surface after using.Multiple Occasions: Suitable for a variety of occasions, toilet, squat, kitchen,wash pool, wash basin. Ideal for all kinds of piping. It can deal with various blockages caused by all sorts of rubbish such as hair, cloth, tea, leaves, grease,oil dirties and so on. Environmentally Friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ey6TaU5RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChuangF","source_asin":"B09QZZTB2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QZZTB2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QZZTB2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
