window.products.push({"id":1038325,"name":"Mikikin Cool Mist Humidifiers, Ultrasonic Air Humidifier for Bedroom, Baby, Nursery, Home, Quiet, 3L Top Fill Humidifier with 360° Rotatable Nozzle, E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xOXdY1swL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSTANT RELIEVE - This cool mist humidifiers effectively humidify the air, improve indoor drying, and help you relieve various discomforts. QUIET & SAFE - It‘s super quiet almost no noise. And when there is no water in the tank, the baby humidifier will auto shut-off. LARGE CAPACITY - The bedroom humidifier has a 3L water tank. It offers 12-24hrs of relaxing time on different settings. PRECISE MIST CONTROL - Simply adjust the mist output by rotating the dial knob and adjust the mist direction by the 360 ° rotating nozzle. It's convenient and precise. TOP-FILL HUMIDIFIER - Widen opening makes it easy to refill and clean. Built-in essential oil tray allows you to enjoy the fragrance while humidifying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xOXdY1swL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mikikin","source_asin":"B09F31BG2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F31BG2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F31BG2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1038326,"name":"Old World Christmas Hanging Tree Ornament, Rugby Ball","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GyM9wHL2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Rugby in simple terms is 90 percent football and 10 percent soccer. History states the game was created in England in 1823 by a 16-year-old student ''With a fine disregard for the rules of football took the ball in his arms and ran with it.'' Today, rugby is a fast-growing sport. Players must have strength, speed and strategy to succeed. Old World Christmas is the premier brand of Christmas ornaments in the country. The founders, Tim and Beth Merck, a couple who shared a special love for Christmas, are credited with revitalizing the art of mouth-blown fine glass ornaments as a result of their reintroducing figural designs to the United States in 1979. Each figural glass ornament produced by Old World Christmas is hand crafted in age-old tradition using the same techniques that originated in the 1800's. Molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds made exclusively for Old World Christmas, before a hot solution of liquid silver is poured inside. The ornaments are then hand-painted and glittered to achieve the beautiful creations. At Old World Christmas our goal is to offer the best in quality, design, and value. We promise to provide high-quality, traditionally designed, hand-crafted ornaments that are created with even more attention to detail than those produced 100 years ago. We are committed to excellent customer service, affordable prices, and fast, efficient shipping that is second-to-none. Package contains (1) Old World Christmas Hanging Tree Ornament, Rugby Ball. Size: 2 1/2 inches. Mouth blown into carved mold. Hand-painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful creations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GyM9wHL2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old World Christmas","source_asin":"B07FMCGVRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMCGVRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMCGVRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
