window.products.push({"id":1038412,"name":"Light Up Tumbler with Straw and Lid, Happy Halloween Orange and Black Double Walled Trick or Treat Cup, 10 Ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HN1FhlYvL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Light Up Tumbler Material - Double Walled Plastic -- This Tumbler Holds 10 Ounces of Liquid, and Measures 5 1/2 Inches in Height by 3 1/2 Inches in Diameter (at the Largest) -- This Fun Tumbler Features a Black Zig Zag Pattern on the Walls with a Matching Bright Orange Straw and Lid -- Reads \"Trick Or Treat\" in Decorative Text with Cute Bat Silhouettes. -- Finally, this Adorable Cup Lights Up in Multiple Different Flashing Patterns for a Bit of Halloween Fun in Any Situation. Please Note this Tumbler is Hand Wash Only and is Not Dishwasher Safe. Do Not Submerge this Cup in Water -- Are you a Halloween lover? Then look no further than this adorable tumbler. Featuring a zig zag pattern and a matching bright orange lid and straw, it reads \"Trick or Treat\" in fun Halloween themed fonts and bat silhouettes. Last but not least, this cup lights up with multiple different flashing patterns for a fun accent to any day! Perfect for iced coffee, water, iced tea or frappachinos, this tumbler is sure to become a flashy addition to your daily routine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HN1FhlYvL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Needzo","source_asin":"B088G1DC62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088G1DC62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088G1DC62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1038413,"name":"Stratton Home Decor Metal and Wood Tray - Farmhouse Round Tabletop Tray for Table Decoration - Rustic Ornament for Coffee Tables, Credenza, Countertop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VUBploD5L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Using a tabletop tray is an underrated decorative hack. If you're someone who likes styling up table surfaces with trinkets, statues, or other decorative pieces you've collected over the years, you know how tricky it can be to figure out how to arrange them. You may end up just placing them on tables haphazardly, just spacing them out evenly because you don't know what else to do. If you're out of ideas, it's time to mix-up your tabletop styling using decorative trays. Spruce up any table surface with the Stratton Home Decor Metal and Wood Tray. Using this round tray is an excellent way to elevate the way you design your coffee table, countertops, or credenzas, especially if you like playing around with a variety of ornaments. By placing such items on this round tray, you're making it all look more cohesive instead of having different pieces all over the place. Measuring 12.00 W x 12.00 D x 3.25 H inches, this farmhouse tray is made of wood and metal for an authentic rustic look. More reasons to love this decorative tray: ✅ Dark stained surface ✅ Sleek black handles ✅ 4 little feet at the bottom for stability Change up the way you assemble decorative ornaments on tabletops. Add the Stratton Home Decor Metal and Wood Tray to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VUBploD5L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stratton Home Decor","source_asin":"B07R1V9TLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R1V9TLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R1V9TLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
