window.products.push({"id":1038673,"name":"Pimpernel Tally Ho Collection Placemats | Set of 4 | Heat Resistant Mats | Cork-Backed Board | Hard Placemat Set for Dining Table | Measures 15.7” x 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rJpQnEemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INCREDIBLE ARTISTRY: Depicting 4 different traditional hunting scenes, Tally Ho placemats are bordered in black with gold accents. Each features a beautiful art print to create a stylish and inviting design for your home. It pairs perfectly with any of your existing decor, making it a wonderful addition to your home or a lovely gift for a friend. STRONG AND STYLISH: Our quality placemats and coasters use a 5mm board topped with a unique and exclusive art print. Each is totally sealed with a high quality coating that is both stain and heat resistant to 212 degrees Celsius. The placemats and coasters are then finished with a hard-wearing cork back that protects precious furniture. SOMETHING FOR EVERYONE: Pimpernel is the premier brand for placemats, coasters, trays and accessories, with an outstanding and unique range that is renowned for its high quality. Pimpernel's exclusive homewares, textiles and gifts are created to suit all tastes, and make wonderful additions to the home. TIMELESS DESIGNS: Portmeirion was founded by legendary ceramic designer Susan William-Ellis in 1960 and has remained at the forefront of contemporary design ever since. Renowned for our tableware and giftware, Portmeirion produces beautiful and unique collections all of which are made to the highest standard to be enjoyed every day. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Pimpernel Tally Ho Collection Placemats - Set of 4. Made of Cork-Backed Board. Each Placemat measures 15.7 inches x 11.7 inches. Product Care: Clean with a damp sponge and dry with a soft cloth. Do not immerse in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rJpQnEemL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pimpernel","source_asin":"B002PC9Z8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002PC9Z8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002PC9Z8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1038674,"name":"Flash Light Up Mugs - Automatic Liqueur Activated Drinkware - Multicolor LEDs Acrylic Clear Brewage Cups with Handle Shot Glasses 10 OZ - 4 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618gYfuEinL._AC_SL1286_.jpg","description":"【AUTOMATICALLY ON AND OFF】Just add liquid to activate the multicolored LED flashing lights in the base of the cup. The lights turn off when the cups are empty. When activated, the LEDs flicker, change color and glow in a beautiful changing rhythm that is sure to delight. 【DESIGN】High transparency acrylic plastic looks like clear glass which reveals a kind of elegance. Checkered and round shapes printed on the cup body looked stylish and relaxed. The liquid (beer, wine or beverage) activated multicolor LED lights bring you unlimited joy and add happy atmosphere. 【PERFECT FOR PARTIES AND SPECIAL OCCASIONS】Best drinkware or decoration for Christmas, New Year‘s Eve, Birthday party, Weddings, Bachelor party, Beer gathering, Bars, Night clubs or Discos. 【PRODUCT PARAMETER】10 OZ (290 ML) Big capacity beer cup, Two long-lasting (nearly 33hours) 2025 coin lithium batteries are included and installed in the bottom of the cup. The battery compartment is sealed with a twist on liquid-resistant cap (Warn: Please don't soak the bottom battery part into water). 【EASY TO REPLACE THE BATTERY】Invert the cup upside down, find the battery compartment on the bottom of the tumbler. Remove the water resistant cover with coin or screwdriver. Install two CR2505 lithium batteries and replace cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618gYfuEinL._AC_SL1286_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestrice","source_asin":"B09PMFVQT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PMFVQT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PMFVQT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
