window.products.push({"id":1038777,"name":"Christmas Garland with Lights, Christmas Wreaths Garland Decorations with Red Berries, Pine Cones, Bows Ornaments for Indoor/Outdoor Xmas Decor (157 '","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W-Xerb2RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas garlands bring you a warm Christmas scene. Use high-quality materials to protect family health. The simple installation gives you a relaxing Christmas decorating experience. . Features: 1. ECO-material: Made of high-quality PVC, its' material is eco-friendly, and non-flammable. The plant garland uses wire to link, so is durable and hard to break. 2. Christmas Decorations: The Christmas garland has many exquisite red berries, pine cones, and bowknot. They make this garland full of vitality and diversity. 3. Changeable LED Light : The LED light has two patterns. One is bright constantly, the other is shinning like stars. It can create a warm atmosphere for your Christmas. 4. Additive Ornament: Match of different decor, the pre lit garland can be added special ornaments to it, which makes it more unique. 5. Outdoor & Indoor Decoration: The garland is suitable for decorating the door, staircase, bookshelves, mental, roof, arch, Christmas tree and so on. 6. Become Wreaths: Just link the ring with the hook in the bottom, you can easily change the garland into a Christmas wreaths. 7. Multi-purpose: This lighted garland not only makes to decor Christmas Festival but also can decor till New Year. 8. Washable Garland: The garland is dyed evenly, waterproof, washable and colorfast.. What’s in the bag: 70 inches Christmas Garland x 1157 inches LED lights with 40 bulb x 1. Tips: - Clean by the duster regularly. - Be careful with your hands, avoid scratching by wire! Service guarantee: We are committed to providing customers with better service and high-quality products. If you have any questions about the products, feel free to contact us. We will try our best to help. Warning: LED lights require 3 AA batteries, batteries are not included!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W-Xerb2RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonwolf","source_asin":"B07Z3WSPG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z3WSPG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z3WSPG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
