window.products.push({"id":1038861,"name":"Electric Milk Frother, 4-in-1 Electric Milk Steamer, 10.1oz/300ml Automatic Hot/Cold Foam Maker Milk Warmer for Latte, Cappuccinos, Macchiato, Chocola","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jy0qIMPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Food Grade Material. 10.1oz/300ml Capacity】Lavedovy's milk frother comes with 10.1oz/300ml capacity to make smooth and dense milk foam for a cup of cappuccinos, lattes, and macchiatos at home. The inside of the froth cup is made of food grade materials with non-stick coating, making it safe to use and easy to clean. ☕【Automatic Power Off for Safe Operation】This electric milk frother/steamer makes warm milk froth in less than 3 mins. It automatically powers off when the milk temperature reaches 60±7℃（140±44.6° F）, so no worries about milk over heated or spilling. The dry boil protection feature also protects the steamer for long-term use. ☕【Advanced Magnetic Drive. Quiet & Fast】This automatic milk foam maker has adopted advanced magnetic drive technology, its stirring paddle froth milk fast and evenly to get hot/cold milk foam in just minutes. With Lavedovy instant milk frother, you can make yourself a cup of aromatic latte quickly in the morning. ☕【Detachable Cup & Lid for Easy Cleaning】The separatable design makes this milk frother easy to maintain. You may detach the froth cup from the electric base and simply throw it into the dishwasher, while the lid with whisk can be easily cleaned by rinsing under running water. ☕【Super Easy One-Touch Button Control】No skills required with this milk frother/steamer. Only one button touch for milk frothing or milk steaming. Just remember not to add milk higher than the max level and you can get hot/cold dense milk froth for latte and cappuccino, or heated milk for making a hot chocolate. 📩【ONLINE AFTER-SALES SUPPORT & 1 YEAR WARRANTY】: We have a professional after-sales support team. We also promise 1 year warranty. If you have any problem while using it, never hesitate to send us email and we will provide the best solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jy0qIMPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavedovy","source_asin":"B09V6VJ35R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V6VJ35R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V6VJ35R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
