window.products.push({"id":1038921,"name":"SEASHORE TREE Kitchen Dish Towels Waffle Dishcloths Sets Dish Cloths Absorbent 12x12inches/13x28inches Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TBZJZLdCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌴Super Absorbent, Strong Decontamination】100% cotton waffle wipes, the surface is three-dimensional and the unique yarn surface is more textured. Therefore, the water absorption is fast and the water absorption is large; the surface of the waffle cloth has stronger contact with dirt and is easier to get rid of dirt. 🌴Various choices】SEASHORE TREE kitchen towels are available in four colors: Beige, Red, Grey and Plum Brown, which is convenient for you to distinguish and also allows you to change a style and mood at any time. There are 12.9*28inch and 12.9*12.9inch two sizes and the number of pieces: 6, 6, 8.Various combinations to meet your different needs. 🌴Applicable to Different Scenarios】Suitable for cleaning marble, stainless steel, ceramic tile, glass and wood and other materials. Can be used to scrub or dry cookware, dishes, cups, sinks, tubs and showers. It is an ideal towel for cleaning at home, restaurants and hotels. 🌴Easy to use and durable】Waffle honeycomb three-dimensional weave, more fluffy and light, easier to wring out moisture, more hanging button design, after washing can be hung directly in the kitchen area, while there will be no water drops dripping down, keep the kitchen furniture and floor tidy. The latest technology and upgraded yarn make our wipes more durable and less shrinkage after washing. 🌴SEASHORE TREE Towel Quality Assurance】Machine washable, tumble dry, do not bleach. We spare no effort to serve you. If there is any problem with the product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TBZJZLdCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEASHORE TREE","source_asin":"B095WWMZ4P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WWMZ4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WWMZ4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1038922,"name":"Wifey And Hubby - 11oz Ceramic Coffee Mug Couples Sets - Funny Couple Gifts For Him And Her - Mr & Mrs Gift set - Husband And Wife Engagement Present ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kzl0-guML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 2-mug Wifey/Hubby Couple Mug  set makes a great gift for the special couple in your life, or keep one and give one to your significant other. These sturdy ceramic stoneware mugs will last many mornings of coffee or tea with the one you care about. Enjoy your favorite hot drink, whiskey, wine, or any other beverage of your choice with the person whose personality and mug match yours. These matching coffee mugs for couples make a great present for your favorite couple, whether you need a gift for an anniversary, engagement, wedding, or friend gift, or when you want to show your appreciation and gratitude to a special couple. Enjoy your morning coffee, tea, or juice in one of our 11-ounce ceramic mugs, great for cold drinks and hot drinks alike, while declaring your love for someone special. Start a great day with our lovers’ mug, perfect for everyday use. Our stoneware mugs with the design on both sides make a great gift or souvenir for any occasion, from birthdays to engagements, housewarmings, long-distance relationships, or simply missing that special person. Any time you want to show your appreciation with a cute and thoughtful gift anyone can use, the Wifey/Hubby Couple Mug design mug has your back. Each of our high-quality, scratch-resistant, dishwasher- and microwave-safe mugs is printed using the “sublimation method.” This technique leaves a permanent, non-fading design on both sides of your mug. We carefully package and ship each box of mugs to help the product arrive safely at your door. Your mug features: A sturdy mug for hot or cold drinks with an easy-grip, large handle A sturdy mug for hot or cold drinks with an easy-grip, large handle Cadmium free / lead free Cadmium free / lead free Design printed on both sides Design printed on both sides Dishwasher- and microwave-safe Dishwasher- and microwave-safe Images won’t crack, fade, peel, or scratch Images won’t crack, fade, peel, or scratch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kzl0-guML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crazy Bros Tees","source_asin":"B06XKK7NKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1038922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XKK7NKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XKK7NKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
